PhyloClear
==========

Copyright (C) 2026 PhyloClear contributors.

PhyloClear is an independent, from-scratch reimplementation (in Python) of the
functionality of FigTree, a graphical phylogenetic tree viewer originally
authored by Andrew Rambaut.

FigTree
-------
Original project: https://github.com/rambaut/figtree
Original author:  Andrew Rambaut (2006-2014)
